    "updated_at": "2023-05-08T12:14:52Z",
    "body": "Looks like all browser engines immediately fetch every byte from `fetch(\"http://localhost:5000\")` even without accessing `.body` at all. And I'm not familiar with how the fetch suspension works exactly. @jesup, can you help?\r\n\r\n(I tweaked the number to 200001 and 200000 and browsers still fetched all 40 MB data)",
