    "body": "Forget my previous comment, it's `no-store` and this works:\r\n\r\n```py\r\nr = Response(my_generator(), status=200, content_type='application/json')\r\nr.cache_control.no_store = True\r\nreturn r\r\n```\r\n\r\nHope this helps!",
